From a9509a96a9edfea2a22caf5b129d1c6c94eeb07a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 12:59:45 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Security banner: one row, one button

The first-boot box already sets the network name, the Wi-Fi key and the
router login in one step, so the banner no longer shows two rows with two
buttons. While both are factory it shows one line (RSEC_13) and one call
to action, the box's own title "Set up this router" (RWFS_1). If only the
login remains the button goes to the password page; if only the Wi-Fi
remains, to the box. The done-rows are gone: the body text already says
which half remains. RSEC_13 added to all 25 packs with translations.

Owner request 2026-09-06 after the first metal reset on v3.1.0 (banner
seen, button not yet exercised).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
